stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initiated
    Initiated --> FundsHeld: Checks pass and funds are held
    Initiated --> Rejected: Checks fail or funds are insufficient
    FundsHeld --> SentToBiller: Request sent to biller
    SentToBiller --> Completed: Biller confirms payment
    SentToBiller --> Failed: Biller refuses payment
    SentToBiller --> Unknown: No answer within the timeout
    Unknown --> Completed: Biller later confirms payment
    Unknown --> Failed: Biller later refuses or reconciliation finds no payment
    Failed --> Refunded: Hold released to the wallet
    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]